  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      99.38,
      329.67,
      526.69,
      343.73
    ],
    "text": "In addition, quite apart from the seriousness of the offence, can the",
    "fonts": [
      "BookmanOldStyle-Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      99.38,
      350.79,
      526.72,
      364.85
    ],
    "text": "consequences of an offence be a legitimate aggravating (as opposed to",
    "fonts": [
      "BookmanOldStyle-Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      99.38,
      371.91,
      526.76,
      385.97
    ],
    "text": "mitigating) factor while awarding a sentence. Thus, to understand the",
    "fonts": [
